Hi everyone, Dima here<p>Echo is a rethinking of what personal CRMs could be. I kept meeting amazing people, but weeks later I’d forget who was who or lose the thread entirely.
Existing CRMs were built for sales teams, not humans. They&#x27;re never up to date, and it&#x27;s impossible to find relevant information.<p>I built Echo to be your personal assistant for relationships.
Met someone new? -&gt; say &quot;Add John to contacts&quot;
Want to remember something? -&gt; say &quot;Sarah said she loves pizza.&quot;
Looking for someone? -&gt; say &quot;Who do I know that&#x27;s an engineer?&quot;<p>Would love to hear your thoughts on it!<p>You can start using it for free.
